TI  - Social Choice for Heterogeneous Fairness in Recommendation (SCRUF-D)
PY  - 2024
UR  - https://arxiv.org/html/2410.04551v1
N1  - arXiv:2410.04551 ; cite egalement comme ACM Transactions on Recommender Systems, 3(2), 2024
AB  - Algorithmic fairness in recommender systems requires close attention to the needs of a diverse set of stakeholders that may have competing interests. Our work approaches recommendation fairness from the standpoint of computational social choice, using a multi-agent framework.
