TI  - Exploring Social Choice Mechanisms for Recommendation Fairness in SCRUF
PY  - 2023
UR  - https://arxiv.org/pdf/2309.08621
N1  - arXiv:2309.08621
AB  - Fairness problems in recommender systems often have a complexity in practice that is not adequately captured in simplified research formulations. This paper explores a range of options for choice mechanisms in multi-aspect fairness applications.
